Write a message to work with your agent. Follow up in the same conversation.

Keys
  enter              send message
  ctrl+c             stop work, clear the draft, or leave
  / · @ · ?          commands, files, and keyboard shortcuts (on an empty composer)
Commands
  /help [advanced]                   keys and commands
  /receipt [run]                     show the result and checks
  /diff [run]                        review changes
  /apply [run]                       apply changes to your working tree
  /new [path]                        open another Chat; this one keeps working
  /projects                          open a Chat in another project
  /chats                             switch to another Chat
  /inbox                             what the Chats want from you (ctrl+space)
  /quit                              leave

More controls: /help advanced
